00:08:55.409 --> 00:08:56.410 line:92%
<c.colorFEFEFE>Wait a second!</c>

00:08:56.410 --> 00:08:58.912 position:59% line:92%
<c.colorFEFEFE>What if your kid is actually allergic?</c>

00:08:58.912 --> 00:09:02.915 position:58% line:91%
<c.colorFEFEFE>What if none of the things we've said
