00:09:50.864 --> 00:09:53.000 line:92%
<c.colorFEFEFE>anecdotes, and misinformation.</c>

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:56.168 position:61% line:92%
<c.colorFEFEFE>And feelings are often immune to facts.</c>

00:09:56.870 --> 00:09:59.339 line:91%
<c.colorFEFEFE>We'll not convince anybody
